        "id": "deferred-equation-scope",
        "severity": "blocking",
        "message": "The Story asks for a plotter able to take “any equation” (source line 8), while the specification limits this to one equation using common arithmetic, x, and standard functions, and defers parametric equations, implicit equations, and multiple expressions (L-GRAPH:REQ-001; boundary conditions and out-of-scope sections). Clarification Q-001, specification generation 1, records the person's requested starting scope and deferrals, so this is not an unanswered clarification. However, the deferred portions remain excluded from this generation's coverage; retain them as an explicit product scope decision before treating the source's broader “any equation” commitment as settled.",
